  "name": "@rxap/ngx-status-check",
  "description": "This package provides Angular components and services to check and display the status of various services. It includes a status indicator component, a status check component, a service to retrieve status information, and a guard to protect routes based on service status. It also provides utilities for configuring status check intervals and integrating with OpenAPI.\n",
